      "message": "Yes. HAL implementation can register for a death recipient for the callback and when the service dies and can clean up all the channels.\n\nYou can take a look at \"hardware/interfaces/nfc/1.0/default/Nfc.h\" and \"hardware/interfaces/nfc/1.0/default/Nfc.cpp\" for an example.\n\n virtual void serviceDied(uint64_t /*cookie*/, const wp\u003c::android::hidl::base::V1_0::IBase\u003e\u0026 /*who*/) {}\nmCallback-\u003elinkToDeath(this, 0 /*cookie*/)",
